    "K0H-ZR-UrB.ibShadowedToolTip" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"NSButton\"; ibShadowedToolTip = \"Some programs (such as vim and emacs) want to put the numeric keypad in \\\"application\\\" mode. Turn this off if you always want it to act as a numeric keypad. NOTE: This setting affects the older xterm control sequence (CSI > Pp m), not the Kitty control sequence related to CSI > flags u.\"; ObjectID = \"K0H-ZR-UrB\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some programs (such as vim and emacs) want to put the numeric keypad in \"application\" mode. Turn this off if you always want it to act as a numeric keypad. NOTE: This setting affects the older xterm control sequence (CSI > Pp m), not the Kitty control sequence related to CSI > flags u."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alguns programas (como vim e emacs) querem colocar o teclado numérico no modo “aplicativo”. Desative isto se você quiser que ele sempre funcione como um teclado numérico. NOTA: Este ajuste afeta a sequência de controle mais antiga do xterm (CSI > Pp m), não a sequência de controle do Kitty relacionada a CSI > flags u."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "某些程序（如 vim 和 emacs）希望将数字小键盘置于“应用”模式。如果你希望它始终作为数字小键盘使用，请关闭此选项。注意：此设置影响较旧的 xterm 控制序列（CSI > Pp m），而非与 CSI > flags u 相关的 Kitty 控制序列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
